== Trivia ==
* Circle of Protection is based on a cycle of <u>Magic: the Gathering</u> cards of the same name, which similarly provide defensive effects to their wielder.
* Circle of Protection's in-game icon may be based on the band A Perfect Circle's logo. The pickup quote is also similar to the lyrics of their song Pet.

